# The comments describe the run on a node (DESIGN.md §10, "On a node"). On a node, account 0
# deploys, so it is the owner.
Owner
IsOwner
IsOwner from=1
Bump from=1               # not the owner: Panic(1)
Bump
SetOwner account1 from=1  # not the owner
SetOwner 0                # zero owner
SetOwner account1
Owner
IsOwner
IsOwner from=1
Bump from=1
Renounce                  # not the owner
Lock from=1
SetOwner account0 from=1  # locked
Renounce from=1
Owner
Bump from=1               # nobody owns it
